<% title 'Delete Your Data' %>

<h1>Delete Your Data</h1>

<p>To delete your Blitzen Trapper forum account and the data linked to it, including an account created with Facebook login:</p>

<ol>
  <li>Email <%= mail_to privacy_email, privacy_email, subject: 'Delete my forum account' %> from the address on your account, or include your forum username.</li>
  <li>We'll delete your account, profile and posts, and reply to confirm, usually within 30 days.</li>
</ol>

<p>If you used to sign in with Facebook, you can also remove the app from your Facebook account under Settings &amp; privacy › Settings › Apps and websites. We no longer receive anything from Facebook, so to delete your forum account, email us as well.</p>

<p>See our <%= link_to 'privacy policy', privacy_path %> for more about the data we keep.</p>
